id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
45418::$$$message_0422_0000_0000$$$::"Tokiomi, I'm bored. Is there anything interesting going on?"::
45419::$$$message_0422_0000_0001$$$::"The Tohsaka clan is ashamed to have invited Your Heroic Majesty to this world only for you to feel bored."::
45420::$$$message_0422_0000_0002$$$::"I've prepared this entertainment for you. Is it to your liking?"::
45421::$$$message_0422_0000_0003$$$::"...What are these pebbles on strings?"::
45422::$$$message_0422_0000_0004$$$::"American clackers, crafted by the esoteric Jewel Magecraft of the Tohsaka clan. They seem to be very popular with young commoners."::
45423::$$$message_0422_0000_0005$$$::"..."::
45424::$$$message_0422_0000_0006$$$::"Then how about an excursion, Archer? Just earlier, my informants at the Holy Church reported a supernatural phenomenon called the Holy Grail Onsen."::
45425::$$$message_0422_0000_0007$$$::"Holy Grail Onsen... It hardly sounds refined. Tell me about it."::
45426::$$$message_0422_0000_0008$$$::"It may be a variant wish-granter that has manifested in Fuyuki.[wvl canskip=false time=200][hffgchg2 chara=è¨€å³°4th face=æ¥½ pos=left time=300 textclear=0] Master, I believe the Second Owner is obligated to investigate."::
45427::$$$message_0422_0000_0009$$$::"Hmm. But that would mean neglecting our core pursuit, the Holy Grail War..."::
45428::$$$message_0422_0000_0010$$$::"That's it, Tokiomi. Let us quest in search of this Holy Grail Onsen. Surely you would not question my decree?"::
45429::$$$message_0422_0000_0011$$$::"...I understand, Your Majesty. I will prepare to depart."::
45430::$$$message_0422_0000_0012$$$::"...Hm, now where did Aoi put the suitcases? Perhaps I need to make a call to the Zenjou household..."::
45431::$$$message_0422_0000_0013$$$::"Heh. What wind has blown through you, Kirei? It's unusual for you to make such a proposal."::
45432::$$$message_0422_0000_0014$$$::"I...don't particularly have any motive."::
45433::$$$message_0422_0000_0015$$$::"Though, it doesn't surprise me that the Holy Grail would be realized as an onsen resort, after being neglected for such a long time."::
45434::$$$message_0422_0000_0016$$$::"And I certainly did not want to see the light fade from my master's eyes as he realized the indignity of it."::
45435::$$$message_0422_0000_0017$$$::"Oh?"::
45436::$$$message_0422_0000_0018$$$::"Suppose, for instance, if he found the Swirl of the Root at the bottom of a bathtub."::
45437::$$$message_0422_0000_0019$$$::"His impudent goatee, dripping with bathwater, would shrivel in on itself with despair..."::
45438::$$$message_0422_0000_0020$$$::"I would never fantasize about such a scene, Gilgamesh."::
45439::$$$message_0422_0000_0021$$$::"Hehehe. So you are continuing to learn what true pleasure is. I knew I wasn't mistaken." ½